# When Craterclaw Colossus enters, creatures you control gain trample and get +X/+0 until end of turn, X the number of artifacts you
# control (CR 611.2, 608.2h). Bot1 controls Mox Ruby, Gleemox, Mox Jet, Mox Sapphire, Sol Ring and the Colossus itself (an artifact
# creature): X = 6, so the Colossus is 11/5 and Ragavan (not an artifact) 8/1, both with trample (the Colossus has haste of its own).
# Bot2's Ornithopter (an artifact creature it controls) is neither pumped nor trampling and is not counted in X (Power stays 0).
# The effects end at cleanup: next turn the Colossus is back to 5/5 without trample (haste is printed, so it keeps it).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Gleemox
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Ragavan, Nimble Pilferer
Sol Ring
Craterclaw Colossus
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

